{
  "info": {
    "name": "Smart Dog Collar API",
    "description": "Worker API. Set `baseUrl` to `http://localhost:8787` (`pnpm dev`) or the deployed Worker URL.\n\nSign in first with **Auth → Login**: it stores the access token in `accessToken`, which every request sends as `Authorization: Bearer …` (collection auth). On localhost with LIVE_VIEW_UNAUTHENTICATED=true no login is needed (ADR 0004, ADR 0010).\n\nDevice commands go through the bridge, which validates them and publishes to `pettracker/{id}/device/…` with a backend-generated request_id / setting_id (spec V3 §4, §6, ADR 0009, ADR 0011). Firmware: see the Firmware folder (ADR 0012).\n\nTo publish raw MQTT messages (as a collar), see docs/postman/README.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8787"
    },
    {
      "key": "deviceId",
      "value": "dog001"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "firmwareVersion",
      "value": "1.0.1"
    },
    {
      "key": "releaseId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const s = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', s.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', s.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Username + password (ADR 0010). Saves accessToken and refreshToken.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const s = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', s.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', s.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "New access token when the old one expired (401 auth_required).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The signed-in user and role."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
